               <h2>R Vasudevan Moorthy </h2>
<b>Chairman Emeritus </b>
 <br/> <br/>
<p>Mr. R. Vasudevan holds a bachelor’s degree in Civil Engineering from the University of Pune. He has also completed an ‘Owner President’ Management Program from the Harward Business School. He has been a Promoter Director on the Board of the Company since January <span class="num-font">1, 1986.</span> He is responsible for the overall management of our Company. He has over <span class="num-font">33</span> years of experience in the Construction Company. </p>
