<p>Mr. K. G. Krishnamurthy holds a bachelor’s degree in architecture from the Indian Institute of Technology, Kharagpur. He has <span class="num-font">31</span> years of experience in the areas of real estate, construction finance, property valuation and property search services. He is currently the Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer of HDFC Property Ventures Limited. He has also been appointed on the board of various companies. He has been appointed as a Director on the Board of our Company since June <span class="num-font">21, 2006.</span></p>
